NNAAMMEE
       set_mempolicy  -  set  default  NUMA memory policy for a thread and its
       children

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
       NUMA (Non‐Uniform Memory Access) policy library (_l_i_b_n_u_m_a, _-_l_n_u_m_a)

