       EEFFAAUULLTT Part  of all of the memory range specified by _n_o_d_e_m_a_s_k and _m_a_x_n_‐
              _o_d_e points outside your accessible address space.

       EEIINNVVAALL _m_o_d_e is invalid.  Or, _m_o_d_e is MMPPOOLL__DDEEFFAAUULLTT and _n_o_d_e_m_a_s_k is  non‐
              empty,  or  _m_o_d_e is MMPPOOLL__BBIINNDD or MMPPOOLL__IINNTTEERRLLEEAAVVEE and _n_o_d_e_m_a_s_k is
              empty.  Or, _m_a_x_n_o_d_e specifies more than a page  worth  of  bits.
