              TTIICC__NNOODDEESS and MMPPOOLL__FF__RREELLAATTIIVVEE__NNOODDEESS.  Or,  the  MMPPOOLL__FF__NNUUMMAA__BBAALL‐‐
              AANNCCIINNGG isn’t supported by the kernel, or is used with _m_o_d_e other
              than MMPPOOLL__BBIINNDD.

